@startuml
title Selective Lua Scripting Layer - 선택적 Lua 스크립팅 계층

package "C# Skill Runtime" {
  class NY_Skill_Instance
  class NY_Skill_EffectModule
  class NY_Skill_ConditionModule
}

package "C# Scripting Gateway" {
  class NY_Scripting_Gateway
  class NY_Scripting_Context
  class NY_Scripting_Result
  class NY_Scripting_ErrorReporter
  class NY_Scripting_Metrics
}

package "Lua Runtime Wrapper" {
  class NY_Scripting_LuaRuntime
}

package "Lua Scripts" {
  class damage_formula_lua
  class burn_condition_lua
  class buff_trigger_lua
}

NY_Skill_Instance --> NY_Scripting_Gateway : Damage Formula 요청
NY_Skill_EffectModule --> NY_Scripting_Gateway : Effect 계산 요청
NY_Skill_ConditionModule --> NY_Scripting_Gateway : Condition 검사 요청

NY_Scripting_Gateway --> NY_Scripting_Context : 실행 데이터 구성
NY_Scripting_Gateway --> NY_Scripting_LuaRuntime : 안전 실행 요청
NY_Scripting_LuaRuntime --> damage_formula_lua : Lua Script 실행
NY_Scripting_LuaRuntime --> burn_condition_lua : Lua Script 실행
NY_Scripting_LuaRuntime --> buff_trigger_lua : Lua Script 실행
NY_Scripting_LuaRuntime --> NY_Scripting_Result : 결과 반환
NY_Scripting_Gateway --> NY_Scripting_ErrorReporter : 오류 기록
NY_Scripting_Gateway --> NY_Scripting_Metrics : 실행 시간 / 성공 실패 기록
NY_Scripting_Gateway --> NY_Skill_Instance : Result 반환

note right of NY_Scripting_Gateway
Lua는 Core Framework를 침범하지 않는다.
모든 호출은 Gateway를 통과한다.
실패 시 C# fallback을 사용한다.
end note

@enduml
